+| R20-GPT-01 | PARTIAL | [width-screen.mjs:74](/workspace/panel-r21/fannan/release/tools/width-screen.mjs:74) classifies whole/partial cuts; `:237` resolves reveals. Inspected regression [panel-r20.test.mjs:64](/workspace/panel-r21/fannan/release/tests/panel-r20.test.mjs:64) asserts declared accordion/carousel PASS, undeclared reveals FAIL, partial cuts FAIL and permanently hidden paragraphs FAIL. Those assertions would fail without the changes. Media scope and reveal identity remain incorrect: R21-GPT-01/03. Browser regression not rerun. |
