+| R20-GPT-03 | PARTIAL | [visibility.mjs:470](/workspace/panel-r21/fannan/release/tools/visibility.mjs:470) captures painted/transparent text; `:434` uses the glyph result. Inspected regression [panel-r20.test.mjs:102](/workspace/panel-r21/fannan/release/tests/panel-r20.test.mjs:102) rejects pale text over the light photo while accepting the scrim and gradient cases. The selected `glyphRatio` regression at `:126` executed PASS. The measure still discards failing glyphs: R21-GPT-02. Browser regression not rerun. |
