+| R20-GPT-05 | PARTIAL | [pre-handoff-check.mjs:181](/workspace/panel-r21/fannan/release/tools/pre-handoff-check.mjs:181) loads the default JS-off baseline; [integrity.mjs:184](/workspace/panel-r21/fannan/release/tools/integrity.mjs:184) removes approved slot-owned additions. Inspected regression [panel-r20.test.mjs:138](/workspace/panel-r21/fannan/release/tests/panel-r20.test.mjs:138) requires slotted PASS and rejects unplaced/unslotted additions. [local-fixture.mjs:347](/workspace/panel-r21/fannan/release/tests/local-fixture.mjs:347) asserts whole-state PASS; that assertion would fail without the fix. Replacement panels remain blocked: R21-GPT-05. Writing fixtures not executed. |
